---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base title="About" section="about" heading="About FOCify.ME" tagline="A personal project, built to show <span>Filecoin Onchain Cloud</span> working">
  <section class="result-section">
    <div class="result-card">
      <div class="prose" style="margin-top:0">
        <p>focify.me exists because Filecoin Onchain Cloud is easier to understand when you can click on something that works than when you read about it.</p>
        <p>It is not an official site. It is not run by FilOz, the Filecoin Foundation or Protocol Labs, and nothing here speaks for them. Demos built by other people are listed with their names and link to where they live; they are not copied here.</p>
        <h2>How this site is hosted</h2>
        <p>The gallery pages are a static build, plain files with no server behind them, made so they can be pinned to Filecoin Onchain Cloud with <a href="https://github.com/filecoin-project/filecoin-pin">filecoin-pin</a> like anything else on this site. The <a href="../">converter</a> runs on a small server because it has to drive a browser.</p>
        <h2>Keeping it honest</h2>
        <p>Every demo entry carries the date it was last confirmed working. A link checker runs on every change to this site. If something here is broken, it will say so or be removed rather than left to rot.</p>
        <h2>Source</h2>
        <p>The whole thing, including the crawler behind the converter, is at <a href="https://github.com/TippyFlitsUK/focify-me">github.com/TippyFlitsUK/focify-me</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
